"Ask Anthropic for Claude's limits" = "从 Anthropic 获取 Claude 用量上限";
"Reads the sign-in Claude Code keeps in the Keychain and asks api.anthropic.com for your 5-hour and weekly limits about once an hour, so they also move when another app or claude.ai uses them. While that sign-in has expired they stop updating, until Claude Code signs in again. The sign-in is never changed or sent anywhere else." = "读取 Claude Code 存在钥匙串中的登录信息，大约每小时向 api.anthropic.com 查询 5 小时和每周上限，其他应用或 claude.ai 的用量也会反映。登录过期期间不会更新，直到 Claude Code 重新登录。登录信息不会被修改，也不会发送到其他地方。";
"Claude Code status line" = "Claude Code 状态栏";
"Takes Claude's 5-hour and weekly limits from what Claude Code passes to its status line, and keeps running your own status line as before. Nothing leaves this Mac." = "从 Claude Code 传给状态栏的数据中获取 Claude 的 5 小时和每周用量上限，并照常运行你原来的状态栏。数据不会离开这台 Mac。";
"Connected. The limits update while Claude Code runs." = "已连接。Claude Code 运行时，用量上限会随之更新。";
"Not connected." = "未连接。";
"Something else has changed Claude Code's status line since you connected. Connect again to use the new one." = "连接之后，Claude Code 的状态栏被其他程序改动了。要使用新的设置，请重新连接。";
"Couldn't change Claude Code's settings." = "无法修改 Claude Code 的设置。";
"Live Claude limits?" = "实时获取 Claude 用量上限？";
"Nunsseop can read the sign-in Claude Code keeps in the Keychain and ask Anthropic directly for your 5-hour and weekly limits, about once an hour, so they update without Claude Code running." = "Nunsseop 可以读取 Claude Code 存在钥匙串中的登录信息，大约每小时直接向 Anthropic 查询 5 小时和每周上限，无需运行 Claude Code 即可更新。";
"Turn On" = "开启";
"No Thanks" = "不用了";
"Click to join" = "点按加入";
"Notifications" = "通知";
"Recent notifications" = "最近的通知";
"Notifications from agents, terminals and your calendar show up here" = "来自代理、终端和日历的通知会显示在这里";
"Remove" = "移除";
"Go to where it came from" = "前往来源";
"Agents at work" = "工作中的代理";

/* Eyebrow auto-hide */
"Hide the eyebrow when it sits unused on a screen without a notch" = "在无刘海屏幕上闲置时隐藏眉毛";
"Hide after" = "隐藏时间";
"Move the pointer to the top edge to bring it back." = "将指针移到屏幕顶部即可重新显示。";
"Eyebrow glass tint" = "眉毛玻璃浓度";

/* Updates through Homebrew */
"Copy Update Command" = "拷贝更新命令";
"Copied" = "已拷贝";
"The command goes to the clipboard. Paste it in Terminal and press Return." = "命令会拷贝到剪贴板。粘贴到“终端”中并按下 Return 键。";
"Get Homebrew" = "获取 Homebrew";
"Updates come through Homebrew. Install it, then come back here to copy the update command." = "更新通过 Homebrew 进行。请先安装 Homebrew，再回到这里拷贝更新命令。";
